        <mxCell id="scope" value="order-fulfillment mid-rollout: build A is Current, build B is Ramping. Shows which object the release edits, what the Worker Controller and KEDA each write, and how each build reaches the server. Who starts workflows and what activities call is workflows/temporal-keda." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontColor=#475569;" vertex="1" parent="1">
